        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Es posible que</choice_text>
          <commentary>접속법을 요구한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Es probable que</choice_text>
          <commentary>접속법을 요구한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>A lo mejor</choice_text>
          <commentary>A lo mejor이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Ojalá</choice_text>
          <commentary>접속법을 요구한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="3" id="PRB-D585F570E3350553-Q3">
      <question_stem>No te vayas sin que el profesor te ________________ los exámenes corregidos.</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords />
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>haya dado</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 스페인어 · sin que + 접속법
정답은 ④이다. sin que는 항상 접속법을 요구한다. 주절이 명령(No te vayas)이고 '교수님이 시험지를 돌려주기 전에'라는 완료의 의미이므로 접속법 현재완료 haya dado가 적절하며, 주어가 교수이므로 3인칭이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>ha dado</choice_text>
          <commentary>직설법은 쓸 수 없다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>habrá dado</choice_text>
          <commentary>직설법 미래완료는 쓸 수 없다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>hayas dado</choice_text>
          <commentary>2인칭 형태이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>haya dado</choice_text>
          <commentary>haya dado이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
