          <choice_text>① tantos</choice_text>
          <commentary>tantos는 misterios와 일치한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>② descifrado</choice_text>
          <commentary>descifrados가 되어야 하므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>③ el</choice_text>
          <commentary>el은 el misterio를 대신한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>④ cien</choice_text>
          <commentary>cien은 명사 앞 형태로 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
